ment_content":"膜拜老师，谢谢老师！","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":170031,"user_name":"sun留白","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1531348,"ip_address":"","ucode":"53FEEA5E244C9A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/5d/d4/e5ea1c25.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1578494851,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":5,"product_id":100027701,"comment_content":"进程唤醒的时候，为何内核为何不直接把数据读到共享区，而是先读到内核去，在拷贝到用户区？\n请问老师。","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1549032,"avatar":"","nickname":"Zzz","note":"","ucode":"9323254354868B","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":289005,"discussion_content":"这就涉及到前几节所讲的数据在内核缓存区 本地内存流转的知识了，知识有关联性的","content_length":38,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1593955831,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":170029,"user_name":"sun留白","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1531348,"ip_address":"","ucode":"53FEEA5E244C9A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/5d/d4/e5ea1c25.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1578494717,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":5,"product_id":100027701,"comment_content":"进程唤醒的时候，为何内核为何不直接把数据读到共享区，而是先读到内核去，在拷贝到用户区？\n请问老师。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":170024,"user_name":"sun留白","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1531348,"ip_address":"","ucode":"53FEEA5E244C9A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/5d/d4/e5ea1c25.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1578494150,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":5,"product_id":100027701,"comment_content":"唤醒线程的时候为何，内核不是直接数据放在共享区，而是放在内核区，然后再有内核去想用户去拷贝，请问老师？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":170017,"user_name":"sun留白","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1531348,"ip_address":"","ucode":"53FEEA5E244C9A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/5d/d4/e5ea1c25.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1578493212,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":5,"product_id":100027701,"comment_content":"用户空间上还有一个共享库和 mmap 映射区，Linux 提供了内存映射函数 mmap， 它可将文件内容映射到这个内存区域，用户通过读写这段内存，从而实现对文件的读取和修改，无需通过 read&#47;write 系统调用来读写文件，省去了用户空间和内核空间之间的数据拷贝。\n请问老师，这一段是用户程序已经通过系统调用，将数据从硬件资源读到了内存空间，然后用户需要用者须数据时，可以直接使用共享去的数据，不用讲数据从内核空间拷贝到用户空间，省去了拷贝仅仅拷贝这一过程？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":170012,"user_name":"sun留白","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1531348,"ip_address":"","ucode":"53FEEA5E244C9A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/5d/d4/e5ea1c25.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1578492417,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":6,"product_id":100027701,"comment_content":"32位机器的内存16个g，每个进程虚拟出来4g。请问老师，这个进程的个数有控制吗，是和CPU的个数有关联吗？\n","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1131235,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/42/e3/bf72015f.jpg","nickname":"猕猴桃","note":"","ucode":"005E562CC3A9A7","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":172570,"discussion_content":"同问","content_length":2,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1581780021,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":168898,"user_name":"朱东旭","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1242338,"ip_address":"","ucode":"C48DD620A63868","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/f4/e2/dbc4a5f2.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1578212791,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":6,"product_id":100027701,"comment_content":"您好，老师，您提到阻塞的本质是将&quot;进程&quot;的task_struct移出运行队列，添加到等待队列，将这里的&quot;进程&quot;改为&quot;用户线程&quot;是否更准确。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":128098,"user_name":"楊_宵夜","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1019302,"ip_address":"","ucode":"7BA0CADC5F23BB","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/8d/a6/22c37c91.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1566830918,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":6,"product_id":100027701,"comment_content":"李老师好，能说说nio下的内核态及用户态的切换情形吗？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":121364,"user_name":"aroll","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1023524,"ip_address":"","ucode":"3A1A1267C88CC3","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/9e/24/0d6a7987.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1565107265,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":6,"product_id":100027701,"comment_content":"老师请问一下，sendfile系统调用时，文件内容通过DMA模块被复制到内核缓冲区中。如果此时应用程序还要操作读出来的数据，而不是直接通过socket将数据发送出去，那么是不是还是避免不了数据从内核空间复制到用户空间？   还是说sendfile和mmap可以一起用，此时只需要在共享内存空间中操作即可？","like_count":0}]}